1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,500
Start with a leek, chopped nice and fine.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,000
Then an onion, sliced thin.

3
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:19,500
Green pepper goes into the hot pan first.

4
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:25,000
Add the onion and cook slowly
until it is soft and sweet.

5
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,000
Set the soft veg aside on a plate.

6
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:34,000
Pour in the cream and let it warm up gently.

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:39,000
Stir in the blue cheese until it melts away.

8
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:44,000
Meanwhile, boil the
gnocchi for just a minute.

9
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:49,000
Bring the soft veg back
into the creamy sauce.

10
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:53,000
Halve some cherry tomatoes for freshness.

11
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,000
Tip them into the sauce.

12
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:01,000
Drain the gnocchi well.

13
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:06,000
Add the gnocchi to the sauce
and mix it all together.

14
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:11,000
Plate it up while it is nice and hot.

15
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:15,500
Finish with plenty of grated Gruyère.

16
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:20,500
And that's it. Creamy,
cosy and ready to eat.
